  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3302.01 “American Society for Testing and Materials (ASTM) E 541-08” means the standard criteria for agencies engaged in system analysis and compliance assurance for manufactured building, including any documents referenced therein.\n\nSource. #5439, eff 7-24-92; ss by #6810, INTERIM, eff 7-25-98, EXPIRES: 11-22-98; ss by #6885, eff 11-18-98;ss by #8012, eff 12-19-03; ss by #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19 (formerly Saf-C 3302.02)",
